"step-card\">\n136:                     <div class=\"step-badge\">Step 1</div>\n137:                     <div class=\"step-icon\">🏛️</div>\n138:                     <h3 class=\"step-title\">Institutional Issuance</h3>\n139:                     <p class=\"step-desc\">The accredited registrar registers the graduate's award. A deterministic SHA-256 cryptographic signature is computed over student identity and academic parameters.</p>\n140:                 </div>\n141:                 <div class=\"step-card\">\n142:                     <div class=\"step-badge\">Step 2</div>\n143:                     <div class=\"step-icon\">⛓️</div>\n144:                     <h3 class=\"step-title\">Blockchain Mining</h3>\n145:                     <p class=\"step-desc\">The qualification fingerprint is mined into an immutable block containing the previous block hash and proof-of-integrity nonce, preventing any future record alterations.</p>\n146:                 </div>\n147:                 <div class=\"step-card\">\n148:                     <div class=\"step-badge\">Step 3</div>\n149:                     <div class=\"step-icon\">🔍</div>\n150:                     <h3 class=\"step-title\">Authorized Verification</h3>\n151:                     <p class=\"step-desc\">Accredited verifiers, employers and institutions sign in to verify certificate serial numbers, inspect SHA-256 digital hashes, and evaluate real-time AI fraud risk scores.</p>\n152:                 </div>\n153:             </div>\n154:         </div>\n155:     </section>\n156: \n157:     <!-- Blockchain Explorer Section (Bonus Feature 1) -->\n158:     <section class=\"blockchain-section\" id=\"blockchainSection\">\n159:         <div class=\"container\">\n160:             <div class=\"section-header\">\n161:                 <span class=\"section-tag\">Bonus Feature: Distributed Ledger</span>\n162:                 <h2 class=\"section-title\">Live Blockchain Credential Ledger</h2>\n163:                 <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Real-time immutable cryptographic blocks anchoring qualification certificates.</p>\n164:             </div>\n165: \n166:             <div class=\"blockchain-card\">\n167:                 <div class=\"blockchain-card-header\">\n168:                     <div>\n169:                         <h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 1.15rem; color: #0f172a;\">⛓️ Cryptographic Block Stream</h3>\n170:                         <span style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b;\">Consensus: Proof-of-Integrity (PoI) • Hash Algorithm: SHA-256</span>\n171:                     </div>\n172:                     <button class=\"btn-outline btn-sm\" onclick=\"validateBlockchain()\">\n173:                         🔍 Validate Full Chain Integrity\n174:                     </button>\n175:                 </div>\n176: \n177:                 <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n178:                     <table class=\"blockchain-table\">\n179:                         <thead>\n180:                             <tr>\n181:                                 <th>Block #</th>\n182:                                 <th>Timestamp</th>\n183:                                 <th>Certificate No.</th>\n184:                                 <th>Payload Hash</th>\n185:                                 <th>Previous Block Hash</th>\n186:                                 <th>Block Hash</th>\n187:                                 <th>Action</th>\n188:                             </tr>\n189:                         </thead>\n190:                         <tbody id=\"blockchainTableBody\">\n191:                             <tr><td colspan=\"7\" style=\"text-align: center; color: #64748b;\">Loading blockchain blocks...</td></tr>\n192:                         </tbody>\n193:                     </table>\n194:                 </div>\n195:             </div>\n196:         </div>\n197:     </section>\n198: \n199:     <!-- Agentic AI & Advanced Features (Bonus Features 2 & 3) -->\n200:     <section class=\"features-section\" id=\"featuresSection\">\n201:         <div class=\"container\">\n202:             <div class=\"section-header\">\n203:                 <span class=\"section-tag\">DevOps & Enterprise Security</span>\n204:                 <h2 class=\"section-title\">DevOps Architecture & Bonus Modules</h2>\n205:                 <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Engineered to meet enterprise software quality, CI/CD, and multi-cloud deployment benchmarks.</p>\n206:             </div>\n207: \n208:             <div class=\"features-grid\">\n209:                 <div class=\"feature-card\">\n210:                     <div class=\"feature-icon\">🤖</div>\n211:                     <h3>Agentic AI Fraud Detection</h3>\n212:                     <p>Heuristic anomaly engine analyzing date timelines, signature patterns, and serial formatting to catch forged degrees before acceptance.</p>\n213:                     <span class=\"feature-pill\">AI Anomaly Scoring</span>\n214:                 </div>\n215:                 <div class=\"feature-card\">\n216:                     <div class=\"feature-icon\">⛓️</div>\n217:                     <h3>Blockchain Ledger</h3>\n218:                     <p>Cryptographic hash chaining with Genesis block foundation and Proof-of-Integrity consensus ensuring zero retroactive tampering.</p>\n219:                     <span class=\"feature-pill\">SHA-256 Chaining</span>\n220:                 </div>\n221:                 <div class=\"feature-card\">\n222:                     <div class=\"feature-icon\">☁️</div>\n223:                     <h3>Infrastructure-as-Code</h3>\n224:                     <p>Production Terraform modules (VPC, ECS Fargate, RDS) and Kubernetes manifests for automated multi-cloud provisioning.</p>\n225:                     <span class=\"feature-pill\">Terraform & K8s</span>\n226:                 </div>\n227:                 <div class=\"feature-card\">\n228:                     <div class=\"feature-icon\">📊</div>\n229:                     <h3>Real-Time Telemetry</h3>\n230:                     <p>Live Actuator metrics, JVM memory telemetry, and verification velocity monitoring dashboards.</p>\n231:                     <span class=\"feature-pill\">Prometheus & Actuator</span>\n232:                 </div>\n233:                 <div class=\"feature-card\">\n234:                     <div class=\"feature-icon\">🔒</div>\n235:                     <h3>Advanced Security & RBAC</h3>\n236:                     <p>Stateless JWT authentication, BCrypt password hashing, and role-based permissions (Admin, Institution, Verifier).</p>\n237:                     <span class=\"feature-pill\">Zero-Trust JWT</span>\n238:                 </div>\n239:                 <div class=\"feature-card\">\n240:                     <div class=\"feature-icon\">🚀</div>\n241:                     <h3>DevOps CI/CD Pipelines</h3>\n242:                     <p>Automated GitHub Actions workflow running Checkstyle static analysis, JaCoCo >80% coverage quality gates, and Docker multi-stage builds.</p>\n243:                     <span class=\"feature-pill\">GitHub Actions</span>\n244:                 </div>\n245:             </div>\n246:         </div>\n247:     </section>\n248: \n249:     <!-- Floating Agentic AI Verification Assistant Widget -->\n250:     <div class=\"ai-widget-container\" id=\"aiSection\">\n251:         <button class=\"ai-floating-btn\" onclick=\"toggleAiChat()\" id=\"aiToggleBtn\" title=\"Ask QVS AI Assistant\">\n252:             <span class=\"ai-btn-icon\">🤖</span>\n253:             <span class=\"ai-btn-text\">AI Verification Assistant</span>\n254:             <span class=\"ai-btn-pulse\"></span>\n255:         </button>\n256: \n257:         <div class=\"ai-chat-window\" id=\"aiChatWindow\" style=\"display: none;\">\n258:             <div class=\"ai-chat-header\">\n259:                 <div class=\"ai-header-info\">\n260:                     <span class=\"ai-avatar\">🤖</span>\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any l